{"kind": "mod", "id": 1389, "name": "Raid Movie Background Replacer", "slug": "raid-movie-background-replacer", "teaser": "Replaces the background of the main menu using clips from the Raid series. Doesn't change music. \r\n\r\n\r\nRequires EFT Api: https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-eft-api/", "owner_name": "Caes3r", "downloads": 1289, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "GNU AGPLv3", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:55.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-05-07T17:18:55.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-05-07T17:18:55.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.8.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/agpl-3.0/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Installation: Simply copy everything to BepInEx/Plugins folder. You might need to clean temp files in the SPT launcher!</strong></p>\n<p>This was made with the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1895-environment-replace/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">environment replace mod</a>. All i did was editing the Raid movie and put combat scenes of it in this mod.</p>\n<p>To remove the beta label in the menu you can install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1505-politelyremovebeta/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PolitelyRemoveBeta</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1289, "published_at": "2024-05-07T17:18:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1389/raid-movie-background-replacer/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}